    "description": "Performed a broad range of activities that included assisting in the configuration and setup of a new suite of geographically distributed data processing and report generation equipment\n\nAssisted data analysts in the development and refinement of scripts required for generating contract deliverables from a common database\n\nMaintained an older suite of equipment running in parallel to new equipment until Final Operation Capability (FOC) was achieved\n\nSupported contract requirements for hardware and software inventory and control of both Government Furnished Equipment (GFE) and corporate assets\n\nDeveloped and maintained several programs written in VBA, Visual Basic, C++, .NET and Java.\n\nDeveloped a Java GUI in Windows for accessing data on Unix machines in a graphical format.\n\nServed as Database Administrator (DBA) for several Oracle 8i, 10g, and 11g instances.\n\nDeveloped software to make use of the API for Neuralstar.\n\nDeveloped and maintained software that processed traffic polling and call data from various switch types including EWSD,SL100,KNS,and M1.  Converting the data into a more usable traffic and call data format.\n\nConverted a C++ program into Java that processes call data into billing records for DISA.",
